<title>USA: UroQuest Medical Corp Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>UroQuest Medical Corp Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.01     loss	 $0.10</p>
<p> Net	   loss	    63     loss	   447</p>
<p> Revs			 3,700		    3,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company has reported pro forma revenues that reflect the merger between Bivona Inc and UroQuest, which occurred concurrent with UroQuest's initial public offering in October 1996.</p>
<p>The company has also reported pro forma net income for 1996 of $7,870, or nil per share, which excluded non-recurring merger related costs of $783,000, to reflect the merger between Bivona and UroQuest.</p>
</text>
